    "text": "On \u00fe\u00e6r\u00e6 m\u00e6ran tide \u00fee se mildheorta H\u00e6lend wunode mid mannum on so\u00f0re menniscnysse, wundra\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea se mildheorta Crist \u00feurh his godcundan mihte \u00feone mann geh\u00e6lde, and \u00f0one hetelan deofol\n\u00dea s\u00e6don \u00fea Iudeiscan \u00fe\u00e6t ure Drihten sceolde \u00fea wundra wyrcan on \u00fe\u00e6s deofles mihte \u00fee men hata\u00fe\nSume hi woldon eac \u00fe\u00e6t he sum syllic tacen of heofonum \u00e6teowde, ac he cw\u00e6\u00fe him to, \u00fea \u00f0a he\nGif se sceocca so\u00f0lice is on him sylfum tod\u00e6led, hu m\u00e6g \u00feonne standan his rice sta\u00feolf\u00e6st?\nGe secga\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t ic adr\u00e6fde deofla of mannum \u00feurh \u00f0\u00e6s deofles mihte \u00fee menn hata\u00fe Beelzebub, and gif\n\u00deis s\u00e6de se H\u00e6lend be his apostolum, \u00fee w\u00e6ron heora suna and heora siblingas, and hi deofla adr\u00e6fdon\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe se H\u00e6lend to \u00feam heardheortum folce: Witodlice gif ic aflyge on Godes fingre deofla, Godes\n\u00d0onne se stranga healt his inburh f\u00e6ste, \u00feonne beo\u00f0 on sibbe \u00fea \u00f0ing \u00fee he sylf h\u00e6f\u00f0.\nAc gif sum strengra cym\u00f0 and hine oferswi\u00f0, ealle his w\u00e6pna he gewin\u00f0 \u00feonne on \u00feam \u00f0e he truwode,\nSe \u00fee nys mid me, he bi\u00f0 ongean me, and se \u00fee mid me ne gadera\u00fe, he towyrp\u00f0 so\u00f0lice.\n\u00deonne se uncl\u00e6na gast g\u00e6\u00fe ut of \u00f0am men, \u00feonne f\u00e6r\u00f0 he worigende on unw\u00e6terigum stowum secende\n\u00deonne cwe\u00fe se fula gast \u00fe\u00e6t he faran wylle into his huse, of \u00feam \u00f0e he ut ferde, and cym\u00fe \u00f0onne to,\nHe genim\u00f0 him \u00feonne to seofan o\u00f0re gastas wyrsan \u00feonne he sylf sy, and hi wunia\u00fe mid \u00feam men, and\nMid \u00feam \u00f0e he \u00feis clypode, \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00fe him sum wif to of \u00fe\u00e6re menigo mid micelre stemne: Eadig is se\nHire andwyrde se H\u00e6lend: Gyt synd eadigran \u00fea \u00f0e Godes word gehyra\u00f0 and hit gehealda\u00fe.\nWe gegaderia\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t andgyt to \u00feisum godspelle be \u00feam twam godspellerum, Lucam and Matheum, and\nUre Drihten geh\u00e6lde \u00fea \u00feurh his heofonlican mihte \u00feone earmann wodan fram his wodnysse, and fram\nD\u00e6ghwamlice he wyrc\u00fe \u00f0as ylcan wundra gyt, \u00e6fter gastlicum andgite, on Godes gela\u00feunge, on so\u00f0re\n\u00deonne se ungeleaffulla \u00fee l\u00e6g on his synnum gebih\u00fe to his Drihtne mid so\u00fere d\u00e6dbote, and \u00f0one deofol\n\u00dea s\u00e6don \u00fea Iudeiscan \u00fe\u00e6t ure Drihten sceolde \u00fea wundra wyrcan on \u00fe\u00e6s deofles naman \u00fee men hata\u00f0\nHwilon \u00e6r we s\u00e6don be \u00feisum sceandlican deofle.\n\u00d0a h\u00e6\u00feenan leoda gelyfdon on hine and heton hine Beel, sume Baal, and se ylca h\u00e6fde yfelne tonaman,\n\u00d0a h\u00e6\u00feenan him offrodon swa swa healicum gode sceap and hry\u00f0eru, and ofslogon \u00fea; \u00fea gewunedon\nNu s\u00e6don \u00f0a Iudeiscan, urum Drihtne to teonan, \u00fe\u00e6t he sceolde adr\u00e6fan deofla of mannum on \u00f0ises\nSume hi woldon eac \u00fe\u00e6t he sum syllic tacen of heofonum \u00e6teowde, ac hi his fandodon swa.\n\u00dea Iudeiscan gesawon swutele tacna on \u00feam wodan men \u00fee \u00f0\u00e6r w\u00e6s geh\u00e6led, and swa\u00feeah woldon\nGif se woruldlica cyning win\u00f0 wi\u00f0 his leoda, and \u00fea leoda wi\u00f0eria\u00f0 wi\u00f0 heora cynehlaford, \u00feonne\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe se H\u00e6lend him to be \u00feam hetelan deofle \u00feus: Gif se sceocca so\u00f0lice is on him sylfum\nNele nan deofol adr\u00e6fan o\u00f0erne, ac hi ealle syrwia\u00f0 mid heora searucr\u00e6ftum mid anr\u00e6dum mode hu\nGe secga\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t ic adr\u00e6fe deofla of mannum \u00feurh \u00f0\u00e6s deofles mihte \u00fee menn hata\u00f0 Beelzebub, and gif\n\u00deis s\u00e6de se H\u00e6lend be his apostolum, \u00f0e w\u00e6ron heora suna and heora siblingas, and hi deofla\nIdeo ipsi iudices uestri erunt: For\u00feam \u00f0a ylcan beo\u00f0 eft eowre deman.\n\u00dea halgan apostolas \u00fee \u00feam H\u00e6lende folgodon on so\u00f0re lare sceolon eft beon ealles manncynnes\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe se H\u00e6lend to \u00feam heardheortum folce: Witodlice gif ic aflige on Godes fingre deofla, Godes\nGodes finger so\u00f0lice getacnode \u00feone Halgan Gast, swa swa Matheus awrat, \u00feisum wordum cwe\u00feende:\n\u00dees finger oferswi\u00f0de so\u00f0lice \u00fea drymen on Egipta lande \u00e6tforan Farao, \u00fea \u00f0a hi wunnon wi\u00f0 Moysen\nMid \u00feisum fingre w\u00e6ron eac swilce awritene Moyses tabulan on \u00feam munte Syna; on \u00f0am tabolum\nGodes hand so\u00f0lice is ure H\u00e6lend Crist, \u00feurh \u00f0one he gesceop ealle gesceafta, and Godes finger is\nNis us nan lim swa gewylde to gehwilcum weorce swa us syndon ure fingras, and for\u00f0i is gehaten se\nNe sceal nan mann wenan, ne on his mode wealcan, \u00fe\u00e6t ure H\u00e6lend sy on his heofonlican mihte l\u00e6sse\nProfecto peruenit in uos regnum Dei: Witodlice Godes rice becym\u00f0 on eow.\nCrist sylf is Godes rice, swa swa he cw\u00e6\u00fe on o\u00f0re stowe: Regnum Dei intra uos est: \u00fe\u00e6t is on Englisc,\nGodes rice is eac Godes gela\u00feung, \u00fe\u00e6t is eall Cristen folc \u00fee on Crist gelyf\u00f0, and he hi gebring\u00f0 eac to\n\u00deonne se stranga healt his inburh f\u00e6ste, \u00feonne beo\u00f0 on sibbe \u00fea \u00f0ing \u00fee he sylf h\u00e6f\u00f0.\nAc gif sum strengra cym\u00f0 and hine oferswi\u00f0, ealle his w\u00e6pna he gewin\u00f0 \u00feonne on \u00f0am \u00f0e he truwode,\nDeofol is se stranga \u00fee ure Drihten embe spr\u00e6c, \u00f0e h\u00e6fde eall manncynn on his andwealde \u00fea \u00f0urh\nQui non est mecum aduersum me est: Se \u00f0e nys mid me, he bi\u00f0 ongean me, and se \u00fee mid me ne\nUres Drihtnes d\u00e6da and \u00fe\u00e6s deofles ne magon nateshwon ge\u00few\u00e6rian ne beon gelice, for \u00fean \u00f0e se\nCrist tih\u00f0 to mihtum symle and deofol to mand\u00e6dum, ac we sceolon gehyrsumian urum H\u00e6lende\nEac \u00fea manfullan menn \u00fee mistihta\u00fe o\u00f0re to deofollicum weorcum wi\u00f0eria\u00f0 ongean Crist, and mid\n\u00d0onne se uncl\u00e6na gast g\u00e6\u00fe ut of \u00feam men, \u00feonne f\u00e6r\u00f0 he worigende on unw\u00e6terigum stowum,\nHe forl\u00e6t \u00fea cl\u00e6nan mod \u00fee Criste \u00feeowia\u00f0, \u00fea \u00f0e \u00feurh syfernysse syndon unw\u00e6terige, and him reste\n\u00d0\u00e6s deofles rest bi\u00f0 on deorcum sceadewum for \u00f0an \u00f0e he sl\u00e6p\u00fe on \u00f0am sweartum ingehydum \u00fee\nSe deofol bi\u00f0 adr\u00e6fed \u00feurh ures Drihtnes mihte of \u00feam h\u00e6\u00feenan men \u00feonne hine man fulla\u00f0; \u00feonne\n\u00d0onne cwe\u00fe se fula gast \u00fe\u00e6t he faran wylle into his huse of \u00feam \u00fee he ut ferde, into \u00feam Cristenan\nHe cym\u00fe \u00feonne to and afint hit aswapen, and eac swilce \u00e6mtig and eall him ged\u00e6ft.\nSe man bi\u00f0 gecl\u00e6nsod fram his uncl\u00e6num synnum \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t halige fulluht on \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes naman;\n\u00d0a seofon gastas syndon \u00fea seofan heafodleahtras, gyfernyss and forlir, gytsung and yrre, asolcennyss\nGif \u00f0as heafodleahtras habba\u00f0 stede on \u00feam menn, \u00feonne n\u00e6f\u00fe Godes gast nane wununge on him, ac\nSe H\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00fe to \u00feam heardheortum Iudeiscum: Sic erit et generationi huic pessime: \u00feus gewyr\u00f0\n\u00d0a \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6t Iudeisce folc underfeng Godes \u00e6, \u00fea ferde se fula gast fram \u00feam folce aweg; ac he cyrde eft\nMid \u00fean \u00f0e he \u00feis clypode, \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00fe him sum wif to of \u00fe\u00e6re menio mid micelre stemne: Eadig is se\n\u00deurh \u00f0ises wifes stemne wurdon \u00fea gescynde \u00fea arleasan Iudeiscan, Drihtnes wi\u00f0ersacan, and heora\nEac \u00fe\u00e6ra gedwolmanna \u00fee dwelodon embe Crist, and s\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t he n\u00e6re on so\u00f0re menniscnysse,\n\u00d0is wif getacnode untwylice mid wordum and mid anr\u00e6dum geleafan ealle Godes gela\u00feunge, \u00fe\u00e6t is\nHire andwyrde se H\u00e6lend: Gyt syndon eadigran \u00fea \u00f0e Godes word gehyra\u00f0 and hit gehealda\u00fe.\nEadig is Maria \u00fe\u00e6t arwyr\u00f0e m\u00e6den, \u00fe\u00e6t heo Godes Sunu ab\u00e6r bli\u00f0e to mannum; ac heo is swa\u00feeah\nEac syndon eadige \u00fea ealle \u00fee gehyra\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t halige Godes word and hit healda\u00f0 mid lufe.\nUton herian urne Drihten, and \u00fe\u00e6t halige Godes word eac swilce lufian and mid geleafan gehealdan.\n\u00d0\u00e6s us geunne se \u00e6lmihtiga Wealdend, se \u00f0e a rixa\u00f0 on ecnysse; amen.",
